Agreed, and agreed, but not all.


>	1.  Moria seems to treat "running" better than NH.  In Moria, the 
>"."  command functions like the "g" NH command except that Moria has 
>options for continuing to "run" around corners, through doors, etc.  NH 
>seems to only go in a straight line, which is nice but not as useful as 
